{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a perilous journey in &quot;Crown of Kings&quot; where you awaken as a knight with no memory or equipment, thrust into the depths by the menacing Lich King. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/ani_traps.gif?t=1753068414\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate treacherous, randomly generated dungeons brimming with deadly traps and relentless foes eager to challenge your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/ani_mummy.gif?t=1753068414\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect lost artifacts, piece together your mysterious past, and evolve from a disarmed survivor into a formidable hero. Each deeper venture promises greater challenges and richer rewards. Dare to uncover your destiny and reclaim your lost honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your path through darkness and danger in &quot;Crown of Kings&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2550910?t=1753068414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753068414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/4ffc13f621fc1a7a7cafc4f2d536946115ffe676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753068414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/4ffc13f621fc1a7a7cafc4f2d536946115ffe676/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753068414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id"